{"seq":2,"slug":"ranking-reranking-pipeline","title":"排序与重排管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/systems/ranking-reranking-pipeline","wordCount":2217,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"排序与重排管线\">排序与重排管线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粗排（Pre-ranking）</td>\n<td>对召回候选做快速初步筛选，从数千降至数百</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精排（Ranking）</td>\n<td>深度特征交叉模型对候选做精细化打分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排（Re-ranking）</td>\n<td>在精排得分基础上做多目标融合、多样性优化和规则干预</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标融合</td>\n<td>将 CTR/CVR/价格等多个目标的预估分数融合为最终排序分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MMR 多样性</td>\n<td>最大边际相关性算法，在相关性与多样性之间取得平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则干预</td>\n<td>商业规则（广告插排、新品扶持）对算法排序的覆盖修正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[召回&lt;br/&gt;数千候选] --&gt; B[粗排&lt;br/&gt;数百候选]&#10;    B --&gt; C[精排&lt;br/&gt;百个候选]&#10;    C --&gt; D[重排&lt;br/&gt;最终结果]&#10;    D --&gt; E[页面展示]&#10;    D -.-&gt; F[多样性优化]&#10;    D -.-&gt; G[规则干预]&#10;    D -.-&gt; H[多目标融合]\">graph LR\n    A[召回&lt;br/&gt;数千候选] --&gt; B[粗排&lt;br/&gt;数百候选]\n    B --&gt; C[精排&lt;br/&gt;百个候选]\n    C --&gt; D[重排&lt;br/&gt;最终结果]\n    D --&gt; E[页面展示]\n    D -.-&gt; F[多样性优化]\n    D -.-&gt; G[规则干预]\n    D -.-&gt; H[多目标融合]</pre><p>推荐系统的排序管线通常分为四个层级：召回（从全量商品中找出相关候选）、粗排（快速筛选召回结果）、精排（深度打分）、重排（综合决策）。精排和重排是最终影响用户体验和商业目标的关键阶段。本文聚焦精排到重排的完整管线设计，深入多目标融合策略、多样性保障机制和规则干预体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排序管线的整体架构\">排序管线的整体架构</h2><h3 id=\"召回到精排的漏斗结构\">召回到精排的漏斗结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"全量商品 (十亿+)&#10;    ↓ 多路召回（协同过滤/内容/热门）&#10;候选集 (数千)&#10;    ↓ 粗排（轻量模型快速筛选）&#10;精排候选 (数百)&#10;    ↓ 精排（深度模型精细打分）&#10;排序列表 (百个)&#10;    ↓ 重排（多样性/规则/业务目标调整）&#10;最终展示 (20-50个)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>全量商品 (十亿+)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 多路召回（协同过滤/内容/热门）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>候选集 (数千)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 粗排（轻量模型快速筛选）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>精排候选 (数百)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 精排（深度模型精细打分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>排序列表 (百个)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓ 重排（多样性/规则/业务目标调整）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最终展示 (20-50个)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每一层缩减候选集规模，同时使用更复杂、更精确的模型。这种漏斗结构的设计动机是<strong>计算资源与延迟的约束</strong>：深度精排模型（DIN/DIEN）对单个候选的计算成本高，只能承受数百个候选；而召回层必须从十亿商品中找出相关候选，只能使用极轻量的向量检索。</p>\n<h3 id=\"粗排-pre-ranking-层\">粗排（Pre-ranking）层</h3><p>粗排是召回和精排之间的效率桥梁，目标是在极低延迟（通常 5-10ms）内从数千候选中快速筛选出数百精排候选，同时尽量不丢失真正相关的优质商品。</p>\n<p><strong>双塔浅层模型</strong>：用类似召回阶段的双塔结构，但增加更多特征和稍大的网络，精度高于纯向量召回，延迟低于精排。</p>\n<p><strong>COLD（Computing power cost-aware Online and Lightweight Discovery）</strong>：阿里开源的粗排架构，设计了专门的轻量特征交叉模块，在保证粗排精度的前提下，严格控制计算成本在精排的5%以内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精排层的多目标建模\">精排层的多目标建模</h2><h3 id=\"单目标精排的局限性\">单目标精排的局限性</h3><p>如果只优化 CTR（点击率），精排结果会倾向于高点击率但低购买转化率的商品（如低价噱头商品）。如果只优化 GMV（成交额），结果会过度偏向高客单价商品，损害用户体验。平台需要同时考虑用户满意度（CTR/停留时长）、平台收益（CVR/GMV）和生态健康（多样性/新品扶持）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分塔多目标预估\">分塔多目标预估</h3><p>使用 ESMM 或 MMoE 架构（见算法章节），为 CTR、CVR、购买金额（Price）等分别建立预估模型，输出多个目标的独立概率分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"精排模型输出：&#10;- pCTR: 0.045（点击率预估）&#10;- pCVR: 0.032（购买转化率预估）&#10;- expected_GMV: 128元（预期成交额）&#10;- satisfaction_score: 0.72（用户满意度预估）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>精排模型输出：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- pCTR: 0.045（点击率预估）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- pCVR: 0.032（购买转化率预估）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- expected_GMV: 128元（预期成交额）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- satisfaction_score: 0.72（用户满意度预估）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多目标线性融合\">多目标线性融合</h3><p>最简单的多目标融合方式：加权线性组合各目标分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>pCTR</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>pCVR</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>pGMV</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = w_1 \\cdot \\text{pCTR} + w_2 \\cdot \\text{pCVR} + w_3 \\cdot \\text{pGMV} + \\ldots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pCTR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pCVR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pGMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 需要根据业务目标的相对优先级人工设定，并随季节（大促期间 pGMV 权重提升）和场景（首页提高满意度权重，搜索结果页提高相关性权重）动态调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"帕累托最优融合\">帕累托最优融合</h3><p>对于相互冲突的目标（如 CTR 和 CVR 的权衡），可以用帕累托最优的方式寻找不存在某个目标可以提升而其他目标不下降的解集：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>pCTR</mtext><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mtext>pCVR</mtext><mi>β</mi></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mtext>price</mtext><mi>γ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}_{Pareto} = \\text{pCTR}^{\\alpha} \\times \\text{pCVR}^{\\beta} \\times \\text{price}^{\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9321em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pCTR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7376em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1168em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pCVR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9166em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">price</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7222em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>乘法形式的融合能避免某个目标为0时整体分数为0的极端情况，且对各目标的量级差异不敏感（不需要归一化）。指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制各目标的相对权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重排层设计\">重排层设计</h2><p>精排得到的排序列表只考虑了每个商品的个体得分，没有考虑商品之间的关系（如相似商品扎堆、重复品牌等）。重排层负责在精排基础上做<strong>全局优化</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多样性优化\">多样性优化</h3><p><strong>问题描述</strong>：如果用户对运动鞋有偏好，精排可能输出10双风格相似的运动鞋。但这对用户而言是冗余的——用户更希望看到几双不同风格/品牌的运动鞋选择，而不是10双几乎一样的商品。</p>\n<p><strong>MMR（Maximum Marginal Relevance）</strong>：经典的多样性优化算法，在相关性（与用户偏好的匹配度）和多样性（与已选商品的差异度）之间取得平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MMR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Rel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>Sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MMR} = \\arg\\max_{d_i \\in D \\setminus S} [\\lambda \\cdot \\text{Rel}(d_i, u) - (1-\\lambda) \\cdot \\max_{d_j \\in S} \\text{Sim}(d_i, d_j)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MMR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.716em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6994em;vertical-align:-0.9494em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9494em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是已选商品集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\setminus S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是剩余候选，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制相关性和多样性的权衡（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 退化为纯相关性排序）。每次贪心选择使 MMR 得分最大的商品加入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，直到凑满展示位数。</p>\n<p><strong>品牌/品类去重</strong>：在同一页面上，限制同一品牌或同一三级品类的商品数量上限（如同品类不超过3个坑位），避免视觉上的单调感。</p>\n<h3 id=\"全局重排-globalrerank\">全局重排（GlobalReRank）</h3><p>MMR 是贪心算法，不保证全局最优。更高级的重排方法使用<strong>列表生成模型</strong>（List-wise Reranking）直接对候选商品的排列序列打分，选择最优的展示序列。</p>\n<p><strong>DPP（Determinantal Point Process）</strong>：用行列式衡量一组商品的质量（所有商品的相关性）与多样性（商品嵌入向量的空间跨度），选择使行列式最大的子集：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(S) \\propto \\det(\\mathbf{L}_S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{L}_S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8361em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 中商品相似度矩阵。DPP 提供了多样性的理论保证，但计算复杂度较高，通常需要近似算法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则干预层\">规则干预层</h3><p>纯算法的推荐结果需要叠加业务规则，规则干预是推荐管线不可或缺的组成部分。</p>\n<p><strong>必须保障的业务规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>违禁品过滤</strong>：绝对不能出现的商品（违规品、违禁品类）</li>\n<li><strong>地区限制</strong>：某些商品不能在特定地区展示（法规限制）</li>\n<li><strong>库存保障</strong>：零库存商品不展示（或降权处理）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>商业化规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>广告插排</strong>：在自然推荐结果中插入付费广告位（通常固定位置，如第4、8位），需要保证广告与自然推荐的相关性阈值（CTR 低于某值不展示）</li>\n<li><strong>合约保量</strong>：平台与特定品牌的合作协议要求保证曝光量，系统需要监控并在自然流量不足时做主动插入</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>运营策略规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新品扶持</strong>：新上架商品需要额外曝光机会，通过加权提升排序分数</li>\n<li><strong>促销活动</strong>：大促期间对活动参与商品的优先展示</li>\n<li><strong>多样性保障</strong>：限制单一商家（卖家）的商品占比，保护中长尾商家的曝光机会</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"规则与算法的冲突处理\">规则与算法的冲突处理</h3><p>业务规则和算法优化之间有时存在矛盾（如强制插入的低相关广告会降低用户体验）。处理策略：</p>\n<p><strong>软约束优化</strong>：将业务规则编码为优化目标的约束条件或惩罚项，让算法在满足约束的前提下最优化目标。</p>\n<p><strong>优先级分层</strong>：硬规则（合规/违禁）&gt; 商业合约 &gt; 算法优化 &gt; 软性运营策略，冲突时按优先级解决。</p>\n<p><strong>效果监控与反馈</strong>：为每类规则干预维护独立的 A/B 实验组，实时监控规则干预对用户体验指标和商业指标的影响，持续优化规则参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟预算分配\">延迟预算分配</h2><p>整个排序管线的端到端延迟通常需要控制在 100-200ms 以内，各层之间的延迟预算分配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型延迟预算</th>\n<th>关键优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回（多路并行）</td>\n<td>20-30ms</td>\n<td>ANN 索引；多路并行执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粗排</td>\n<td>5-10ms</td>\n<td>轻量模型；批量推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征读取</td>\n<td>10-20ms</td>\n<td>本地缓存；批量读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精排推理</td>\n<td>20-40ms</td>\n<td>GPU 推理；模型量化（INT8）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排</td>\n<td>5-10ms</td>\n<td>贪心 MMR；向量化计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>排序与重排管线是推荐系统将算法分数转化为用户体验的工程枢纽。精排层通过多目标建模（ESMM/MMoE）和多目标融合策略（线性加权/帕累托融合）平衡 CTR、CVR、GMV 等多维业务目标。重排层通过多样性算法（MMR/DPP）解决商品同质化问题，通过规则干预层处理广告插排、新品扶持、合规过滤等业务需求。延迟预算管理是保证整个管线在严苛 SLA 约束下稳定运行的关键工程挑战。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"排序与重排管线","id":"排序与重排管线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"排序管线的整体架构","id":"排序管线的整体架构"},{"level":3,"text":"召回到精排的漏斗结构","id":"召回到精排的漏斗结构"},{"level":3,"text":"粗排（Pre-ranking）层","id":"粗排-pre-ranking-层"},{"level":2,"text":"精排层的多目标建模","id":"精排层的多目标建模"},{"level":3,"text":"单目标精排的局限性","id":"单目标精排的局限性"},{"level":3,"text":"分塔多目标预估","id":"分塔多目标预估"},{"level":3,"text":"多目标线性融合","id":"多目标线性融合"},{"level":3,"text":"帕累托最优融合","id":"帕累托最优融合"},{"level":2,"text":"重排层设计","id":"重排层设计"},{"level":3,"text":"多样性优化","id":"多样性优化"},{"level":3,"text":"全局重排（GlobalReRank）","id":"全局重排-globalrerank"},{"level":3,"text":"规则干预层","id":"规则干预层"},{"level":3,"text":"规则与算法的冲突处理","id":"规则与算法的冲突处理"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟预算分配","id":"延迟预算分配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实时特征服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/systems/realtime-feature-service"},"next":{"title":"多触点个性化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/systems/multi-touchpoint-personalization"}}